  "No real customer data: every number here is synthetic, BPI-2019-derived (real structure, synthetic identities) or curated-demo. None of it is a real-company accuracy claim.",
  "The \u226599% auto-link precision guarantee (Learn-then-Test) holds only if deployment data are exchangeable with the calibration data; on a real tenant it must be re-certified on that tenant's reviewed links (shadow mode + audit slice).",
